Subject: [PATCH 219/220] 1256: the connector can answer a question another
 member asked (OFF)

check_my_inbox lists questions_for_me with an ask_id, and no connector
tool took that id: a user living in Claude could read a member's question
and never answer it. answer_member_question finds the ask's own thread for
its recipient (latest round only) and sends through the app's path,
sendApprovedAskAnswer, so D48/D648 and every refusal stay the same.

Registered only when ANSWER_MEMBER_QUESTION_ON is true; it stays false
until Misho says yes to the tool's exact description.

